\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ Ready To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Ensure Smooth Euro Launch -Nikkei \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1998\par 14:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Nikkei)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to mobilize all available means, including market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to help European central banks converge their \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates into euro exchange rates prior to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  integration Jan. 1, The Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported in its Wednesday edition, citing BOJ sources. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will consider emergency supply of liquidity if Japanese financial institutions fail to switch smoothly to the euro from local European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in their transactions from Jan. 4. \par \par \uc2  For trouble-free trading settlement from next year, the BOJ has set up emergency hotlines with Japanese banks and brokerages, as well as overseas central banks, for closer communications over the year-end holiday period. \par \par \uc2  Each nation in the euro-zone has until a meeting slated for the afternoon of Dec. 31. to converge their \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates into the rate that was agreed last May at a meeting of European Union finance ministers. \par \par \uc2  While European central banks are expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to achieve the task by themselves, some may ask for the participation of the U.S. and Japan if their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are exposed to speculative trading. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ believes a smooth switch to the euro is essential to stabilize \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and is ready to respond to a request from countries that haven't signed mutual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  agreements. But the BOJ will confine its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trading of European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 29-12-98 \par \par \uc2  1312GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duct02ctb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
