\par\par \b \uc2  Mark slips against broadly firmer yen in Europe. \b0\par\par\uc2 557 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1998\par 13:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Sept 3 (Reuters) - A stronger mark battled with a firmer yen on Thursday and slid back against the Swiss franc after making gains earlier this week, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The mark slipped to lows just above 78 yen in active trading amid verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials and on talk of Japanese repatriation of capital helped yen gains. \par \par \uc2  "All the talk seems to be about repatriation and the mark is a little undermined relative to the yen by indications the German economy is suffering from the Russian and Asian crises," said Rob Hayward, economic advisor at Bank of Boston in London. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also said investors continued to unwind long dollar/yen positions to cover emerging market losses, buoying the yen. \par \par \uc2  The Reuters German Service Index blamed Asian financial woes on a fall in its main business activity index to 56.8 in August from a revised 57.3 in July. \par \par \uc2  The survey of business executives at 460 service sector companies, covering about 40 percent of the German economic output had some cooling impact both on demand and business expectations. \par \par \uc2  At 1100 GMT mark/yen was trading at 78.38/40 compared with 78.68/70 in late Europe on Wednesday, while the mark was trading just off a nine-month high of 1.7297 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official Haruhiko Kuroda said overnight the yen's correction from weakness has begun and that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at any time. \par \par \uc2  His warnings were echoed by finance ministry colleague, Eisuke Sakakibara, who said it was risky to have large \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions in the current conditions. \par \par \uc2  The mark also slipped back against the Swiss franc as safe-haven flows and the continued unwinding of carry trade supported the franc, pushing it to a seven-month high against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "The market is generally unsettled about where it should be looking for safe-havens," said Steve Barrow, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Bear Stearns in London. "But there is a lot of uncertainty and people don't have a clear idea of whether Swissie should become a super-strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  or not." \par \par \uc2  At 1030 GMT mark/Swiss franc had slipped to 82.15/18 compared with 82.4750 in late Europe on Tuesday and down from earlier session and one-week highs just under 82.60. \par \par \uc2  There was little impact from the Bundesbank's decision to hold its repo rate steady at 3.30 percent, as expected. \par \par \uc2  European politicians put pressure on Russia to continue the process of economic reform if it wants to be bailed out of its economic crisis. \par \par \uc2  The European Commission said it would back international aid to Russia only when reforms were assured and that financial aid would be "useless" without a Russian commitment to reform. \par \par \uc2  German Chancellor Helmut Kohl said the European Union agreed that Russia's stability was critical for Germany and said the whole EU hoped the Duma would confirm Prime Minister-designate Viktor Chernomyrdin in its second vote on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere the Greek drachma fell against the mark to around 171.81/91 per mark from one-week highs around 169.35 it reached on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  ((Paul Casciato, London newsroom +44 171 542 8968 fax +44 171 542 5293, paul.casciato@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021217du9300pys\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
