\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  IN EUROPE -  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  tension keeps yen firm. \b0\par\par\uc2 531 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1998\par 18:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Aug 20 (Reuters) - The yen continued its march higher in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Thursday, pushing to a fresh three week high against the dollar amid the persistent threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action to support the yen. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the steady stream of Japanese officials' \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  threats is taking its toll on market sentiment and few are willing to test the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve in this environment. \par \par \uc2  "The tension is pretty high. Fundamentally, no one wants to be long yen but at the same time you can't ignore the authorities' threats," said one UK bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  The chief of the Japanese Finance Ministry's International Bureau, Haruhiko Kuroda, was the latest voice added to the chorus of verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While the yen's trend had changed a bit, the yen needs to rise further and \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when necessary, he said overnight. \par \par \uc2  His remarks added to pressure on dollar/yen which eventually tested a low of 141.45 yen in afternoon Europe, its lowest level since July 30. It stood at 144.20/25 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  But the market remains sceptical this is a yen turnaround, and have pointed out much of the recent move has been a defensive trimming of short yen positions. \par \par \uc2  "Probably there are traders taking the view that if there is going to be \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , they might as well wait for that before shorting the yen again," said Glenn Davies, chief economist at Credit Lyonnais Laing. \par \par \uc2  The yen's move so far has been built on the market's painful memories of being caught long of dollars when the Federal Reserve and Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  jointly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in June to buy yen. \par \par \uc2  "These yen gains have been created on the back of verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , not physical, and that will start having a hollow sound to it," said Teis Knuthsen, head of research as SE Banken in London. \par \par \uc2  "And when that happens, you will start seeing the yen reflecting what are still weak economic fundamentals." \par \par \uc2  Against this backdrop and with the market geared up for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action is likely to make only a relatively small impact, said dealers. \par \par \uc2  The options market is also positioning itself for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , mindful of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in June which caught it overbalanced with short yen positions. \par \par \uc2  Analysts also see good chart support for dollar/yen around 142 yen and then at trendline support drawn from this year's lows which comes in at 139 yen. \par \par \uc2  "A move below 140 yen will provide a good point to start going long the dollar again," said SE Banken's Knuthsen. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the dollar was firmer against the mark from earlier lows but still well within the two pfennig range that has persisted this week. \par \par \uc2  It showed little reaction to German July M3 growth of 5.0 percent and was even less surprised with the Bundesbank's decision to leave its repo rate steady at 3.3 percent. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/mark was at 1.7970/80 against 1.7969/79 late Wednesday in Europe. \par \par \uc2  ((Andrew Reierson, London newsroom +44 171 542 6745, uk.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 .news@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8k016fp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
