\par\par \b \uc2  TOCOM platinum rebounds, others down on yen's rise. \b0\par\par\uc2 319 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 1998\par 10:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Aug 19 (Reuters) - Yen-based platinum futures rebounded on Wednesday in line with New York's gains overnight, but other precious metals futures closed lower led by the yen's rise against the dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Platinum futures ranged from nine to 17 yen per gram higher. Benchmark June ended up 10 yen at 1,664 yen. \par \par \uc2  "Platinum was lifted by follow-through buying after New York. Prices were also buoyed by expectations that a higher yen will help boost Japanese platinum demand," one brokerage analyst said. \par \par \uc2  Most investors sold platinum futures on the market's recovery, which made the market's topside heavy, he said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar plunged below 144 yen in Tokyo on Wednesday due to fresh verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's vice finance minister, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Gold futures ranged from seven to 14 yen per gram lower. Benchmark June ended off 11 yen at 1,316 yen. \par \par \uc2  The futures were depressed by the yen's rise and Tuesday's comments by the deputy chairman of Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that Russia is using all instruments to support the rouble, including its gold and other precious metals reserves, traders said. \par \par \uc2  But some investors, believing the yen's rise will be short-lived, hunted for bargains on the market dip, they said. \par \par \uc2  Palladium futures ranged from steady to 19 yen per gram down. Benchmark June ended off seven yen at 1,188 yen. \par \par \uc2  Selling was prompted by the comments by the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official, but persistent scepticism about Russia's ability to generate stable PGM supplies stimulated bargain-hunting by investors, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Silver futures ranged from 0.6 to 3.4 yen per 10 grams down. Benchmark June ended off 2.7 yen at 231.5 yen. ((Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3 3432 7391 tokyo.commodit.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8j013bk\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (japan near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 17/10/1999\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdr